                                                "sense_id": "43d9e34e-7e6d-3aba-b647-5e6bac9ee0dc",
                                                "text": "He saw me catch a trap and leave the house of a drug dealer. That's why he targeted me. He could have easily blown my ass off right then and there for lying, but for some reason he didn't. He just left. I biked back to my plug's spot and told him […]"
